{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26511","headline":"闲居即事 · 费冠卿","name":"闲居即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生计唯将三尺僮，学他贤者隐墙东。\n照眠夜後多因月，扫地春来祗藉风。\n几处红旗驱战士，一园青草伴衰翁。\n子房仙去孔明死，更有何人解指踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"费冠卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}